#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#429 (mes)
- "Master, we can't hire a Kafra Employee because we don't have a contract with the Kafra Main Office. If you want to obtain a contract with the Kafra Main Office, you will need to learn the Guild skill first."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#430 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#431 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#432 (mes)
- "Well... I'm sorry but we don't have enough funds to hire a Kafra Employee."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#434 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#435 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#436 (mes)
- "We obtained a contract with the kafra Main Office, and hired a Kafra Employee."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#437 (cutin)
- "kafra_01"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#438 (mes)
- "[ Hired Kafra Employee ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#439 (mes)
- "How do you do? I was dispatched from the Main Office."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#440 (mes)
- "I'll do my best to not tarnish the reputation of the Guild."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#442 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#443 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#444 (mes)
- "The Contract terms of the hired Kafra Employee are for 1 month and after this term, you will need to pay an additional fee."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#445 (mes)
- "It will be useful for our members."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#446 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#447 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#448 (mes)
- "I did as you ordered, but some of our members will be unhappy. It will be better to hire a Kafra Employee quickly."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#449 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#450 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#451 (mes)
- "Do you want to visit the room where our valuables are stored?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#452 (mes)
- "That room is restricted to you... you are the only one with access to it."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#453 (select)
- "Go into Master's room.:Cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#454 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#455 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#456 (mes)
- "I'll show you the secret path. Follow me...please."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#457 (mes)
- "When you want to return here, please press the secret switch."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#458 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#459 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#460 (mes)
- "Goods are produced once a day... if you don't remove them in time, they will not be produced anymore."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#461 (mes)
- "Therefore, it will be better if you check up on them from time to time."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#462 (mes)
- "[Ringing Voice]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#463 (mes)
- "'Those who overcome an ordeal shows a great deal of bravery... and will find their way to another ordeal.'"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#492 (mes)
- "[Ringing Voice]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#493 (mes)
- "'Only the truly brave can take the test.'"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#495 (mes)
- "There's a small lever. Will you pull it?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#496 (select)
- "Pull.:Don't pull."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/agit_main.txt#498 (mes)
- "Nothing happened."
+ ""

### npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt  (26 textos)
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#2 (mes)
- "[ Edict of the Divine Rune-Midgarts Kingdom ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#4 (mes)
- "1. Follow the ordinance of The Divine Rune-Midgarts Kingdom, "
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#5 (mes)
- "We declare that"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#6 (mes)
- "there is no formal master of this castle."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#8 (mes)
- "2. To the one who can "
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#9 (mes)
- "overcome all trials"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#10 (mes)
- "and destroy the Emperium,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#11 (mes)
- "the king will endow the one with"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#12 (mes)
- "ownership of this castle."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#13 (mes)
- "[ Echoing Voice ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#14 (mes)
- "Brave ones..."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#15 (mes)
- "Do you wish to return to your honorable place?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#16 (select)
- "Return to the guild castle.:Quit."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#19 (mes)
- "[ Edict of the Divine Rune-Midgarts Kingdom ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#21 (mes)
- "1. Follow the ordinance of The Divine Rune-Midgarts Kingdom, "
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#22 (mes)
- "we approve that this place is in"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#23 (mes)
- "the private prossession of ^ff0000"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#24 (mes)
- "^000000 Guild."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#26 (mes)
- "2. The guild Master of ^ff0000"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#27 (mes)
- "^000000 Guild is"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#28 (mes)
- "^ff0000"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#29 (mes)
- "^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#30 (mes)
- "If there is anyone who objects to this,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#31 (mes)
- "prove your strength and honor with a steel blade in your hand."
+ ""
#: npc/guild/aldeg_cas01.txt#35 (mes)
