+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#263 (mes)
- "[ Hired Kafra Employee ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#264 (mes)
- "Thank you, Master!"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#265 (mes)
- "I'll obey your every"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#266 (mes)
