- "has been dismissed."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#277 (mes)
- "Were really dissatisfied"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#278 (mes)
- "by the quality of her service?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#279 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#280 (mes)
- "Will you hire a"
