#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#282 (mes)
- "our stronghold? You must"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#283 (mes)
- "pay ^FF000010,000 Zeny^000000 to hire one."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#284 (select)
- "Hire:Cancel"
