#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#288 (mes)
- "you have not yet attained"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#289 (mes)
- "the ^FF0000Contract with Kafra^000000"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#290 (mes)
- "guild skill."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#291 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
