+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#304 (mes)
- "[ Hired Kafra Employee ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#305 (mes)
- "How do you do? I've"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#306 (mes)
- "been dispatched by the"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#307 (mes)
- "Kafra Head Office to"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#308 (mes)
- "serve your guild's needs."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#309 (mes)
- "I'll do my best to follow"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#310 (mes)
- "your every command, Master."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#311 (cutin)
- "kafra_01"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#312 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#313 (mes)
- "Our contract will expire"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#314 (mes)
- "after one month, so we must"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#315 (mes)
- "pay additional fees to keep"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#316 (mes)
- "this Kafra Employee in"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#317 (mes)
- "the service of our guild."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#318 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#319 (mes)
- "As you command, Master."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#320 (mes)
- "However, I suggest hiring"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#321 (mes)
- "a Kafra Employee as soon"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#322 (mes)
- "as possible since our guild"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#323 (mes)
- "would greatly benefit from"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#324 (mes)
- "the convenient Kafra services."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#325 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#326 (mes)
- "Do you wish to enter the"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#327 (mes)
- "Guild Treasure Room?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#328 (mes)
- "Only you, the Guild Master,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#329 (mes)
- "are permitted to enter."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#330 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#331 (mes)
- "Please remember to open"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#332 (mes)
- "the Treasure Boxes at the"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#333 (mes)
- "proper time. Otherwise, the"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#334 (mes)
- "treasure may disappear if"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#335 (mes)
- "something unexpected happens."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#336 (select)
- "Go to Treasure Room:Cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#337 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#338 (mes)
- "Allow me to guide you"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#339 (mes)
- "on the secret path to"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#340 (mes)
- "the Treasure Room."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#341 (mes)
- "Press the secret switch"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#342 (mes)
- "when you wish to return here."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#348 (mes)
- "[ Steward ]"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#349 (mes)
- "Items in the Treasure Room"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#350 (mes)
- "are produced once each day."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#351 (mes)
- "Therefore, you must obtain"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#352 (mes)
- "the treasure items everyday."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#353 (mes)
- "For the sake of the guild,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#354 (mes)
- "prioritize treasure harvesting!"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#377 (mes)
- "Great job. Now, all you"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#378 (mes)
- "need to do is destroy this"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#379 (mes)
- "Emperium to gain ownership"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#380 (mes)
- "over this stronghold."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#381 (mes)
- "As guardian of this"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#382 (mes)
- "stronghold, I answer only"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#383 (mes)
- "to the master of the guild"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#384 (mes)
- "that controls this place."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#385 (mes)
- "I am "
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#386 (mes)
- ", guardian of"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#387 (mes)
- "this stronghold. For now,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#388 (mes)
- "all is quiet in this place."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#389 (select)
- "Converse:Cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#390 (mes)
- "Do you have any questions"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#391 (mes)
- "about this stronghold?"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#392 (select)
- "Guardian Stones:Fortress Gates:Link Flags:Battle Strategy:Cancel"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#393 (mes)
- "There is one Emperium"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#394 (mes)
- "and two Guardian Stones in"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#395 (mes)
- "each fortress. These stones"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#396 (mes)
- "are the first line of defense,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#397 (mes)
- "and must be destroyed before"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#398 (mes)
- "enemies can even enter."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#399 (mes)
- "The stones are located in"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#400 (mes)
- "^4D4DFFGate Houses^000000 which must be"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#401 (mes)
- "protected to prevent enemies"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#402 (mes)
- "from reaching the Emperium."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#403 (mes)
- "Guardian Stones can ^4D4DFFrecall"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#404 (mes)
- "your Guardians^000000 for protection."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#405 (mes)
- "Fortresses with higher levels"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#406 (mes)
- "of defense can summon more"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#407 (mes)
- "Guardians: this is why it is"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#408 (mes)
- "so important for guilds to"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#409 (mes)
- "invest in Defense Growth."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#410 (mes)
- "Guardian Stones that have"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#411 (mes)
- "been destroyed can be revived"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#412 (mes)
- "after a certain time, but one of the guild members must give"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#413 (mes)
- "me the order. I can also report the status of the Guardian Stones."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#414 (mes)
- "^4D4DFFFortress Gates^000000 are the second line of guild stronghold defense,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#415 (mes)
- "and are protected by extra barricades activated by the Guardian Stones."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#416 (mes)
- "These gates are located in three different parts of the fortress."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#417 (mes)
- "Barricades are protected by"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#418 (mes)
- "Guardian Stones, and are"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#419 (mes)
- "restored when the Guardian"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#420 (mes)
- "Stones are retrieved. However,"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#421 (mes)
- "it is not as easy to restore"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#422 (mes)
- "destroyed Fortress Gates."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#423 (mes)
- "Fortress Gates can only be"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#424 (mes)
- "restored when the ^4D4DFFguild"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#425 (mes)
- "master of a stronghold"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#426 (mes)
- "changes^000000, or if ^4D4DFFrestoration"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#427 (mes)
- "is requested by the guild"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#428 (mes)
- "master of the stronghold^000000."
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#429 (mes)
- "Strongholds have many"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#430 (mes)
- "Link Flags that allow you"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#431 (mes)
- "to access vital areas within"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#432 (mes)
- "restrictions placed by the"
+ ""
#: npc/guild2/agit_main_se.txt#433 (mes)
- "Barricades. Usually, ^4D4DFFFlag 1"
